BT 1 0 0 1 0 74 Tm /F4 10 Tf 14 TL 1.225815 Tw (In Decentralized Finance \(DeFi\) ecosystems built on the Ethereum blockchain, peer-to-peer transaction ordering is) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.166114 Tw (publicly visible prior to block confirmation. This transparent staging environment, commonly referred to as the) Tj T* 0 Tw .449706 Tw (memory pool or mempool, exposes regular market participants to predatory extraction by automated arbitrage bots, a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.558799 Tw (phenomenon broadly categorized as Maximal Extractable Value \(MEV\). Among various MEV extraction vectors,) Tj T* 0 Tw .266373 Tw (sandwich attacks and priority gas front-running pose the most severe financial threats to retail decentralized exchange) Tj T* 0 Tw (\(DEX\) traders.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 60 389.8898 cm
q
.176471 .215686 .282353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 116 Tm /F4 10 Tf 14 TL .565706 Tw (To mitigate this vulnerability, this report details the complete engineering design and software architecture of "MEV) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.051299 Tw (Shield", an intelligent, real-time blockchain mempool monitoring and pre-execution threat mitigation system. MEV) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.059633 Tw (Shield connects to Ethereum nodes via low-latency Alchemy WebSocket streams, continuously ingesting and) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.017966 Tw (decoding raw pending transaction payloads. Using heuristic detection algorithms, the system evaluates incoming) Tj T* 0 Tw .432373 Tw (transactions across gas price differentials, target router contract selectors, token pair pools, and transaction volume to) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.821969 Tw (detect front-running and sandwich patterns within milliseconds. The platform calculates a composite threat score) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.364685 Tw (\(0\226100%\), quantifies projected slippage losses, and provides users with a direct mitigation pathway by routing) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.728971 Tw (sensitive transactions through private relay networks \(such as Flashbots Protect RPC\) that completely bypass the) Tj T* 0 Tw (public mempool.) Tj T* ET
Q
