BT 1 0 0 1 0 74 Tm /F4 10 Tf 14 TL 4.304145 Tw (Decentralized Finance \(DeFi\) has revolutionized financial asset exchange by replacing centralized clearing) Tj T* 0 Tw .281969 Tw (intermediaries with autonomous smart contracts deployed on public blockchains like Ethereum. Rather than matching) Tj T* 0 Tw .206114 Tw (orders through a centralized order book, Automated Market Makers \(AMMs\) such as Uniswap maintain decentralized) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.077706 Tw (on-chain liquidity pools. When users initiate trades, transactions reside in a public memory pool \(mempool\) before) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.010399 Tw (block validators confirm them. Because transactions in the mempool are publicly readable, predatory actors can) Tj T* 0 Tw (observe trade parameters before execution.) Tj T* ET
